  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobile Justice Teams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">he Mobile Justice Teams (MJTs) project will continue to support locally led justice efforts in Ukraine through the provision of legal experts in the field of war crimes investigations and prosecutions. It will enhance Ukraine&#x2019;s capacity to investigate and prosecute war crimes, crimes against humanity, and genocide (atrocity crimes).</narrative>
  </description>
